No NAS signalling messages, except the following, shall be processed by the AMF, or forwarded to the SMF, unless the secure exchange of NAS messages has been established for the NAS signalling connection:
a) REGISTRATION REQUEST;
b) IDENTITY RESPONSE, if requested identity type is SUCI;
c) AUTHENTICATION RESPONSE;
d) AUTHENTICATION RESULT;
e) AUTHENTICATION FAILURE;
f) SECURITY MODE REJECT;
g) DEREGISTRATION REQUEST; and
h) DEREGISTRATION ACCEPT.

6.1.1	Overview

a)	UE-requested PDU session establishment procedure;
b)	UE-requested PDU session modification procedure;
c)	UE-requested PDU session release procedure;
d)	Network-requested PDU session modification procedure;
e)	Network-requested PDU session release procedure.

These procedures are used to establish, modify and release PDU sessions in the 5GS.
